an class=\"na\">dayOfYear=</span><span class=\"s\">\"305\"</span><span class=\"nt\">&gt;</span>01<span class=\"w\"> </span>novembre<span class=\"w\"> </span>1714<span class=\"nt\">&lt;/issue&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"nt\">&lt;issue</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"na\">ark=</span><span class=\"s\">\"bpt6k6338236j\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"na\">dayOfYear=</span><span class=\"s\">\"335\"</span><span class=\"nt\">&gt;</span>01<span class=\"w\"> </span>d\u00e9cembre<span class=\"w\"> </span>1714<span class=\"nt\">&lt;/issue&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"nt\">&lt;/issues&gt;</span>\n</code></pre></div></span>"
